From: Drafter 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] winegstreamer: Implement ICodecAPI and the remaining stubs of the H.264 encoder.

ICodecAPI stores and validates the 15 H.264 encoder parameters the conformance test reads, with
ranges, value lists, defaults that follow the output type, notification lists and a settings stream.
GetInputStatus and the lifecycle messages are implemented; the documented E_NOTIMPL answers lose their
FIXME. The codec API todo_wine marks are removed.
